WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.105
When is everyone free? Find the evening, then plan it.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.313
The Schedule tab opens on Time off: a row for each member, a column for each day,

00:00:11.313 --> 00:00:13.318
Off, Tentative or Working.

00:00:13.518 --> 00:00:17.337
The event's days carry its label, and each day counts who is off.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.180
Add my time off sets your own week, a day at a time.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:25.159
Save, and your row fills in, for everyone, without a reload.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.950
This week shows the next seven evenings, and how many are free on each.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:37.061
On Wednesday, everyone's free from seven thirty.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.580
A timeline from noon to midnight shows who works when, and says it in words for a

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.672
screen reader.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.520
My hours takes your own working hours, up to two stretches a day, on the quarter

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:55.103
hour.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.252
Plan dinner in chat opens the Everyone thread with a draft, ready to send, not sent.

00:01:03.452 --> 00:01:07.117
On an evening someone works, it asks those who are free instead.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.485
The Popkin home names the next evening everyone is free.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.213
The Host sets the event from Popkin settings: a label, a first day and a last day.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.711
On a phone, the table scrolls inside the screen, the names fixed.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.895
From ten twenty-four pixels, the headline and its chat action sit side by side.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.771
Schedules has a switch. While it is off, the tab is gone and its screens say so.

00:01:42.771 --> 00:01:44.025
Nothing is lost.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.815
What no screen shows: each member changes only their own row, and a wrapped-up

00:01:52.815 --> 00:01:55.028
Popkin's schedule is read only.

00:01:55.228 --> 00:01:58.183
An open screen follows every change, live.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.521
That is journey twenty-two. Popkin is a platform for pop-up communities.
